# game/BKstory_events.rpy:601
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_7a632306:

    # renza "That's why..."
    renza "所以..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:603
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_50f1e0a7:

    # "Her voice breaks."
    "她的声音有些哽咽。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:605
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_a76667c1:

    # you "Wh... What happened?"
    you "那...那后来发生了什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:607
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_7a632306_1:

    # renza "That's why..."
    renza "所以..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:609
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_523182f0:

    # renza "That's why she didn't even fight it when it happened."
    renza "所以她甚至都没有反抗。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:611
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_d5112e9f:

    # renza "They asked her to put all of her weapons down. Then, the gang leader gave her a long lecture about how he was going to be the new boss in town... That arrogant fuck."
    renza "他们要她把所有武器都放下。然后,帮派头目长篇大论地讲了一通,说他将成为这座城市的新老大...真是个自负的混蛋。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:613
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_4cb40528:

    # renza "And then..."
    renza "然后..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:615
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_d2eb03b6:

    # "She looks at you with teary eyes. You can tell she is reliving the moment."
    "她带着泪眼望着你。你能感觉到她正重温那个时刻。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:617
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_f3946b67:

    # renza "Then he slit her throat."
    renza "然后他割断了她的喉咙。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:619
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_dae0ec55_1:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:621
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_e1430157:

    # renza "It's such a strange thing, you know... My mother was the most formidable fighter you'd ever know. She could take on five or six guards with just a dagger and come out on top."
    renza "你知道,这真是一件很奇怪的事情...我妈妈可是你所知道最厉害的战士。她只用一把匕首就能打败五六个守卫。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:623
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_c6aeb955:

    # renza "But when her time came, she didn't put up a fight, and in less than a minute, she was gone."
    renza "但到了最后时刻,她却连一点反抗都没有,不到一分钟她就走了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:625
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_24be1885:

    # "Tears are freely running down her face now."
    "泪水正不受控制地流下她的脸。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:627
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_5a745d9d:

    # renza "I watched it all happen. That's all I could do. Watch."
    renza "我全程都目睹了一切。我只能看着。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:629
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_dae0ec55_2:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:635
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_55da323b:

    # you "How... How did you escape the gang that killed your mother?"
    you "你是如何逃脱杀害你母亲的帮派的?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:637
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_5fe84635:

    # renza "Well... When he was done with my mom, the fucking asshole turned to me. He was looking at me with his pig-like eyes, and his stare was a pure evil one."
    renza "嗯...当他对我母亲做完那些事情后,这个该死的混蛋转向了我。他用他那猪一样的眼睛盯着我,他的目光里满是纯粹的邪恶。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:639
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_376ca4c2:

    # you "What... What did he want from you?"
    you "他...他想从你那里得到什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:641
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_22f832aa:

    # renza "Well, what do you think? Fuck me, of course!"
    renza "你觉得呢?当然是要操我!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:643
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_65d1efa2:

    # renza "The bastard was reveling in his 'victory', and he thought he could make me his, because I was just young and stupid. Which I was."
    renza "那个畜生沉浸在他的'胜利'中,他以为我只是个年轻愚蠢的人,就能把我据为己有。事实也的确如此。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:645
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_4e7d9711:

    # renza "But I was also a trained killer..."
    renza "但我也是个训练有素的杀手..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:647
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_e4d4afd1:

    # renza "He told his men to move back, and he started to rip my clothes off. But I had already found a way out of my bounds... So instead of him sticking me with his stupid prick, I stuck a dagger in his loins."
    renza "他叫他的手下后退,然后开始撕扯我的衣服。但我已经找到了脱困的办法...所以在他用他那该死的阴茎进入我之前,我用匕首刺进了他的腰部。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:649
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_653add52:

    # you "You... You had a dagger???"
    you "你...你有一把匕首???"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:651
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_467a8a90:

    # renza "I did. I had a dagger the whole time."
    renza "是的,我一直都有一把匕首。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:653
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_10b654a9:

    # you "But..."
    you "但是..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:655
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_4dfbcfb2:

    # renza "I know."
    renza "我知道。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:657
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_d9db997c:

    # "With rage, she wipes her tears with her hand."
    "她用手擦拭着眼泪,满怀愤怒。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:659
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_dda78f9f:

    # renza "I had that dagger THE WHOLE TIME! But I thought, you know, I thought nothing would really happen. I thought it was some kind of game."
    renza "对,我一直都有那把匕首!但我以为,你知道,我以为不会发生什么严重的事。我以为那只是某种游戏。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:661
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_2b126d0d:

    # renza "I was so sure my mom would get me out of this, and that the next day I would be hitting the streets again like nothing happened."
    renza "我很确信我妈妈会把我救出来的,第二天我就能重新回到街头,好像什么都没发生过。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:663
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_ee43edbe:

    # renza "But that's not how it all went down..."
    renza "但事实并非如此..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:665
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_895666e3:

    # you "You must have been so mad."
    you "你一定很生气。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:667
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_50fd16bd:

    # renza "I was. Mad at myself."
    renza "我很生气,对自己感到愤怒。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:669
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_9768842d:

    # renza "But I was also an angry, confused teenager. I couldn't keep all of this anger focused on myself. So I took it out on them."
    renza "但我当时也是个愤怒、困惑的青少年。我无法把所有的愤怒都集中到自己身上,所以我把它发泄到他们身上。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:671
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_96a70992:

    # you "Oh."
    you "哦。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:673
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_3c3dad4d:

    # renza "After I shanked their leader, I turned my rage on them. There must have been ten of them, but none made it out alive. You better believe it."
    renza "在我刺伤他们的头目之后,我把愤怒转移到他们身上。他们可能有十个人,但没有一个活下来。你最好相信我。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:675
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_7d462931:

    # "She has a murderous spark in her eye."
    "她眼中闪烁着杀意。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:677
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_96ee2e51:

    # you "I... I do."
    you "是的,我有。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:679
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_e2069afb:

    # renza "Then I went back to the guild, and I rallied my mom's followers to hit back at what was left of the gang."
    renza "然后我回到了工会,召集起我妈妈的追随者来反击那个帮派的残余分子。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:681
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_62ee8b04:

    # renza "That didn't sit well with some in the guild, however. Leadership over the thieves guild is not a birthright, they said. And many complained that I was risking the guild's resources to carry out my personal vendetta."
    renza "但这并没有得到工会内部某些人的支持。他们说,窃贼工会的领导权不是一种 birthright,并抱怨我在冒着工会资源的风险来满足我个人的复仇欲望。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:683
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_4da4dbac:

    # renza "So they stood against me. But I was mad, angry, angrier than I've ever been. I would have done anything to get revenge."
    renza "所以他们站在了我的对立面。但我当时非常愤怒,比以往任何时候都要愤怒。我会做任何事情来报仇。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:685
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_df9d6b6d:

    # renza "So I used every trick in the book, everything I had learnt. I cajoled, threatened and bribed. I murdered, even, when I had to. Before six months had passed, I was the uncontested leader of the guild."
    renza "所以我使用了我所学会的一切手段,包括讨好、威胁和贿赂。我甚至在必要时也不惜杀人。在不到六个月的时间里,我成为了工会毫无争议的领导者。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:687
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_6a6cc734:

    # renza "Eventually, with the help of my people, I tracked down every last member of the gang which killed my mother. Every one of them met his end, even if I had to send assassins all the way to a Hokoman hut to get him."
    renza "最终,在我部下的帮助下,我追踪到了杀害我母亲的那个帮派的每一个成员。即使我不得不派刺客到北方偏远的村庄来追捕他们,他们每个人都遭到了毁灭性的下场。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:689
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_31fe1d97:

    # you "Wow."
    you "哇。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:691
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_070a0fc4:

    # renza "When they were all gone, I was still filled with anger and rage. It took time for me to realize that I was really mad at myself."
    renza "当他们全部消失后,我内心仍然充满着愤怒和怨恨。我花了很长时间才意识到,我真正生气的对象其实是自己。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:693
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_7c8dba08:

    # you "So you've been beating your chest about this all this time."
    you "所以你一直都在为这件事自责。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:695
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_b23765cf:

    # renza "Almost. But taking care of the guild's business eats up a lot of my time and energy, you know, and I know that eventually, I have to move on."
    renza "差不多吧。但是处理公会事务耗费了我大量时间和精力,你知道的,而且我知道最终我必须要继续前进。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:697
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_15d6b866:

    # you "Yes."
    you "是的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:699
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_9a3c68b0:

    # renza "But some days... Some days are harder than others."
    renza "但是有些日子...有些日子比其他日子更加艰难。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:701
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_aad993d3:

    # "Tears creep back into her eyes."
    "眼泪又回到了她的眼中。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:707
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_0dc61ba6:

    # renza "My mother... My mother was magnificent."
    renza "我母亲...我母亲是了不起的人。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:709
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_822a9ba5:

    # renza "Stealing, fighting, bargaining, plotting... She was a master in all the arts, and the guild is still buzzing with the stories of her feats and accomplishments."
    renza "偷盗、打斗、讨价还价、策划...她在所有这些艺术方面都是大师,公会里到处都在流传着她的英勇事迹和成就。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:711
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_8ba184d2:

    # renza "She robbed the King's Hold not once, not twice, but {i}six{/i} times... Every time, they would devise a new security system, and every time she would find a way around it. It was like a game to her. She was a natural."
    renza "她不是一次,不是两次,而是{i}六{/i}次劫掠了国王的宝库...每次,他们都会设计出新的安全系统,而她每次都能找到绕过它的办法。这对她来说就像一场游戏。她天生就是如此。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:713
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_544cf58b:

    # you "Hey, you're not bad yourself."
    you "嘿,你自己也不赖嘛。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:715
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_0a821e89:

    # "She looks down."
    "她低下头。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:719
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_f93f30cf:

    # renza "Would that I had a tenth of her talent..."
    renza "要是我有她十分之一的才能就好了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:721
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_3906d8c4:

    # renza "In the end, the King even took to leaving notes in the palace vault, pleading with the 'thieves queen' to spare this or that jewel for the young princess... They say that my mother took everything else, but she left those untouched!"
    renza "最后,国王甚至在宫殿的地下室里留下纸条,恳请'女盗贼女王'能够留下这件或那件珠宝给小公主...据说我母亲把其他所有东西都拿走了,但是那些珠宝她一个也没有碰！"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:723
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_bdd4c28c:

    # you "She was really something..."
    you "她真的太厉害了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:725
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_8ab81fdd:

    # renza "She became the leader of the thieves guild around the time she was carrying me. She was spending way more energy than was reasonable for a woman in her position to take care of me, but somehow, she always found the time."
    renza "她在我出生前不久就成为了盗贼公会的领导者。她比一个处于那个地位的人应该付出的还要付出更多精力来照顾我,但不知怎的,她总是能找到时间。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:727
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_d759c39c:

    # renza "I should have appreciated her more..."
    renza "我应该更感谢她的..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:733
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_e1041899:

    # renza "My father? Oh, my father was a brave man..."
    renza "我父亲?哦,我父亲是一个勇敢的人..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:735
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_5fc0f060:

    # renza "So brave that he sailed away to wherever, the night after my mother told him she was pregnant."
    renza "勇敢到在我母亲告诉他她怀孕的第二天就扬帆远航。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:737
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_13300fd4:

    # renza "With skills like hers, I'm sure she could have easily tracked him down and brought him back bound and chained... But she wasn't the vengeful type."
    renza "有她那样的本事,我相信她轻而易举就能找到他,把他绑起来带回来...但她并不是一个报复心重的人。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:739
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_905bb845:

    # renza "I, on the other hand, would not have been so forgiving. *sneer*"
    renza "而我,恐怕就不会那么宽容。*冷笑*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:741
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_1f06bdef:

    # "You wonder if it was meant as a warning."
    "你怀疑这是不是个警告。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:747
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_3c8f93cf:

    # "You look at her tattoo, trying to pretend you're only interested in the artful drawing and not the juicy, fleshy hip underneath."
    "你看着她的纹身,试图装作只对艺术感兴趣,而不是她丰满的臀部。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:749
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_c4cb00b8:

    # "It represents a mythical snake, eating its own tail."
    "这代表一条吞噬自己尾巴的神话蛇。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:751
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_746a44df:

    # renza "This? It's a coming of age tattoo, nothing really... We all get one."
    renza "这个?这只是成人礼的纹身,没什么大不了的...我们都会纹一个。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:753
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我明白了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:755
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_bebee8ea:

    # renza "I had it done when I became the guild leader. In time, it became our unofficial symbol."
    renza "当我成为公会领袖的时候,我就纹了这个。慢慢地,它成为了我们非官方的标志。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:757
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_7c4b8097:

    # renza "It means..."
    renza "它的意义是..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:759
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_70ab9a54:

    # "She looks thoughtful."
    "她若有所思。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:761
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_d2f7707c:

    # renza "Well, nothing really. It's just an old symbol."
    renza "嗯,没什么特别的意思。只是一个古老的符号罢了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:769
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_35a5978a:

    # you " Thanks for telling me the story. I'm sorry I brought back some painful memories."
    you "谢谢你讲述这个故事。对不起,让你想起了一些痛苦的回忆。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:771
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_04234cca:

    # renza "It's alright. I have to revisit this from time to time. It keeps me on edge."
    renza "没关系。我偶尔需要重温这些。这让我保持警惕。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:773
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_4bd7cdcf:

    # you "Take care, Renza."
    you "保重,伦萨。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:775
translate chinese_simplified renza_friend3_menu_0ad922e7:

    # renza "Thank you."
    renza "谢谢你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:785
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_2b8d9bd7:

    # "That night, as you stand by the main entrance greeting customers, you spot a familiar face among the rowdy crowd."
    "那天晚上,当你站在大门口迎接客人时,你在喧闹的人群中看到了一张熟悉的脸。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:789
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_7ce77426:

    # renza "Hi, [MC.name]."
    renza "嗨,[MC.name]。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:791
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_8e3e5c84:

    # you "Renza, hi! This is an honor. What can I do for you?"
    you "伦萨,嗨!这真是太荣幸了。我能为你做些什么吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:793
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_ab57813e:

    # "She blushes a little, a rare sight for Renza."
    "伦萨脸颊微红,这在她身上可是很少见的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:795
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_58b7601f:

    # renza "Well... I came to check your onsen. Provided you have a legitimate use for it, of course."
    renza "那个...我来检查你的温泉。前提是你有合法使用它的理由。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:797
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_04b20070:

    # you "Of course, of course!"
    you "当然,当然!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:799
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_399fa45e:

    # "You yell."
    "你大声喊道。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:801
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_5e9a6e4c:

    # you "Make way! Sill!"
    you "让开!希露!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:805
translate chinese_simplified renza_onsen1_3048e4bc:

    # "With Sill's help, you push patrons and girls away from one of the pools, paying no attention to their complaints."
    "在希露的帮助下,你将顾客和女孩们从其中一个池子旁推开,丝毫不理会他们的抱怨。"

