# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1592
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_b4193318:

    # "You stop for a moment, thinking about what you know about the fairy people."
    "你停下脚步,细想了一下你所知道的精灵种族。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1598
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_e261fa3e:

    # "Graceful, distant, with a fondness for nature and older gods, the elves count expert craftsmen, druids and magicians among their ranks. They are also fierce warriors and archers."
    "优雅、与世无争,热衷于大自然和古老的神明,精灵族拥有杰出的工匠、德鲁伊和魔法师。他们同时也是勇猛的战士和弓箭手。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1600
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_c98d54f7:

    # "There are far more females than males among the fairy people, meaning most roles in elvish society are filled by women, from merchants to war commanders."
    "在精灵族中,女性人数远远超过男性,意味着精灵社会的各种角色几乎都由女性承担,从商人到军事指挥官无一例外。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1602
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_2e8aa9f3:

    # "Although they have walked among other races for centuries, their civilisation and history go back a lot longer than most. Some say their natural lifespan can extend for centuries, although because of the war, violent deaths have become all too common nowadays."
    "尽管他们已在其他种族中生活了数个世纪,但精灵的文明和历史要更为悠久。有人说,他们的自然寿命可以达到数百年,尽管因战争缘故,如今暴力夺走他们性命的事件也变得屡见不鲜。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1604
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_7e5c13f7:

    # "This brings you to your personal experience of elves."
    "这让你回想起你亲身接触精灵的经历。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1621
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_b56e511d:

    # man "Make way!"
    man "让开!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1627
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_06b2e3ff:

    # "Hearing a commotion behind you, you move aside to let a guard patrol move through the market crowd."
    "听到身后的喧嚣,你移开脚步,让一队武装守卫从人群中穿过。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1634
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_74225698:

    # "As the armed guards pass by, you notice they are escorting a heavily armored knight, sporting the Arios crest on his tunic. A templar."
    "经过时,你注意到他们正护送一名身着铠甲的骑士,胸前图腾竟是太阳神家徽。那是一位神殿骑士。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1641
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_ed24da76:

    # you "We see more and more of them in the streets every day... Shouldn't they be on the battlefield?"
    you "这样的神殿骑士在街头越来越常见了....他们难道不该在战场上吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1643
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_486fb70e:

    # "You turn around to glance at the elf girl."
    "你转身去看那个精灵少女。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1645
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_6e058e5f:

    # "She's vanished."
    "她已经消失不见。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1647
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_b7941c26:

    # you "Well, good for her..."
    you "那也好吧...."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1649
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_def13e0a:

    # "Feeling a little curious, you walk over to the stall to see what she was browsing."
    "出于好奇,你走过去看看她在那摊位上看什么。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1651
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel_63b78836:

    # you "'Bernard's love charms and aphrodisiacs', uhm..."
    you "'伯纳德的情爱护符和春药',嗯...."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1667
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_e493cc63:

    # "The junkyard is a dreadful place to take a walk around on most days, thanks to the smell and noise, but today, it seems eerily quiet."
    "正常情况下,由于噪音和臭味,在这废品场闲逛是个糟糕的主意,但今天,这里出乎意料的安静。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1669
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_cbfa2317:

    # you "This silence... I'm not about to fall into another one of those stupid ambushes, am I?"
    you "这静谧...我可不想再遭遇什么愚蠢的伏击了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1671
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_bbfe90c5:

    # "The junkyard is located in the lowest part of the slums. It seems almost empty today."
    "这个废品场位于贫民窟的最底层地带。今天看来几乎是空旷的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1673
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_39052d1e:

    # "You know for a fact that you aren't alone here, however, as crumbling shanty houses line the scrapyard. They're populated with all sorts of rabble and outcasts, who make a living sorting through other people's trash, or simply hiding from the law."
    "不过你很清楚,这里并非无人,四周矗立着破旧的棚屋,居住着各种流浪汉和逃逸分子,他们靠拣拾别人的垃圾为生,或者只是躲避法律。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1676
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_6dc4ba03:

    # you "I guess the guard patrols are too scared of the smell and diseases to come down here..."
    you "我猜护卫巡逻队对这里的臭味和疾病感到太过胆怯,所以不敢进来。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1678
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_51473fd3:

    # "Still, today is an unusually quiet day. Perhaps it's the harsh sun, which mercilessly sheds its burning light on this shadowless place, or some vague sense of menace in the air? But what could be fouler than the normal smell of this place?"
    "但即便如此,今天依旧格外安静。也许是这炽烈的阳光无情地倾泻在这无影无踪的地方,亦或是空气中隐隐的某种威胁?但还有什么比这里平常的恶臭更加糟糕呢?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1681
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_27547976:

    # "Sitting on the top of a large trash hill, you look around you, trying to peer into some of the roughly built shacks, hoping to get a peek into the everyday life of its inhabitants."
    "你坐在一处大垃圾堆的顶上,望向四周,试图窥探几间简陋的棚屋,想一睹这里居民们的日常生活。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1684
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1686
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_34c64472:

    # you "Damn, I'm bored."
    you "该死,我有些无聊了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1688
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_cbb55582:

    # "You had just about enough of this little game, when you spot a familiar figure walking among the crumbling sheds."
    "就在你快要结束这种闲逛时,你注意到一个熟悉的身影在破落的棚屋间穿行。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1692
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_6cd26150:

    # you "Hey! Wait a minute... Isn't it that girl elf?"
    you "嘿!等等....难道不是那个精灵少女吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1695
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_d61bef70:

    # you "That's her..."
    you "那个就是她了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1698
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_6c0262f9:

    # "The pale teenage elf you saw at the spice market is pacing up a narrow alley, walking up to one of the huts into which she promptly enters."
    "你在黑市看到的那个苍白的青春少女正在一条狭窄的小巷里来回踱步,走到一间小木屋门前,然后直接进去了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1702
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_3eef808d:

    # you "So, maybe she lives here, then? That's unexpected for an elf. Still, not a bad place if you want to avoid attention..."
    you "看来她可能就住在这里?这对一个精灵来说可真是意外。不过这个地方要躲避注意倒也还不错..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1704
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_02eccf5d:

    # "Pondering this little piece of information, you turn around and start climbing down from your vantage point. That's when you hear the distinct clanging of armored feet echoing through the junkyard."
    "一边思考着这点小小的信息,你转过身去从观察的地方慢慢向下爬。就在这时,你听到了一阵清晰可闻的盔甲脚步声在垃圾场中回荡。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1708
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_a0c5ef7a:

    # you "Damn... What's this?"
    you "糟糕...这是怎么回事?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1710
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_ba52251c:

    # "A hand on the hilt of your weapon, you hide yourself behind a pile of rubbish, trying to get a glimpse of the party advancing through the junkyard."
    "一手搭在武器的剑柄上,你躲到一堆垃圾后面,试图瞥见那支正在穿过垃圾场的队伍。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1723
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_b7443607:

    # "A patrol of Arios church warriors is making its way through the scrapyard, armored for battle."
    "一支亚里奥斯教会的战士巡逻队正在穿过这片废品堆,全副武装,准备战斗。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1725
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_e23b8590:

    # you "Templars... Here, of all places?"
    you "圣殿骑士们...怎么会出现在这种地方?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1727
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_be68cabe:

    # "You pause to think."
    "你停下来思考。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1730
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_51040c34:

    # you "This must mean they are after this young girl... I should warn her!"
    you "他们一定是在寻找这个年轻女孩...我应该去警告她!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1733
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_6edec953:

    # you "Although, to be sure, this is none of my business..."
    you "当然,这也并不关我的事..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1745
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_98441e41:

    # you "This is an unexpected opportunity. If I deliver that bitch elf to them, I might get rewarded."
    you "这是一个意想不到的机会。如果我把这个该死的精灵少女交给他们,我说不定会得到奖赏。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1748
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_0d96d832:

    # you "Although that does sound cowardly, even though she's just an elf."
    you "尽管这听起来很胆小,更何况她只是个精灵而已。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1760
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_44bca352:

    # you "They must be looking for that girl. After all, Arios templars are tasked with hunting elves..."
    you "他们一定是在寻找那个女孩。毕竟,亚里奥斯的圣殿骑士们被派来猎捕精灵..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1783
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_450c14dc:

    # "Moving silently through the scrapyard, you make your way towards the shanty house where the girl entered, without being seen."
    "你悄无声息地穿过这片废品堆,向那个女孩进入的简陋房屋走去,小心谨慎地避开被发现。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1785
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_fdf918ef:

    # you "It must be this one..."
    you "一定就是这间了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1789
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_31022b92:

    # "Lifting the thick curtain that covers the entrance of the small hut, you slip in quietly."
    "你轻轻掀开遮住小屋门口的厚重帘布,悄悄溜了进去。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1795
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_bb2885ae:

    # "The hut seems surprisingly well-built and comfortable for such a lowly area of the slums."
    "这间小屋看起来意外地结实舒适,很不像这种贫民窟的样子。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1797
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_3522b560:

    # "Looking around the room, you see it is littered with strange apparatuses and mysterious elixirs. Hardly the dwelling of a simple beggar."
    "环顾四周,你发现到处都是奇怪的器具和神秘的药剂。这绝对不是普通乞丐的住处。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1799
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_7f835669:

    # "Half-hidden by a shelf, you see a set of stairs leading down. You hear a muffled sound coming from down there... Neighing?"
    "半隐藏在架子后面,你看到一条楼梯通向下面。你似乎听到了从楼下传来的模糊声响...像是马的嘶鸣?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1805
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_2f9caa6e:

    # gizel "Uh?"
    gizel "啊?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1807
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_078dd4fc:

    # gizel "Who... Who are you?"
    gizel "你...你是谁?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1809
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_62cc41c2:

    # "She recoils from you as she sees your weapons."
    "当她看到你的武器时,她不安地缩了回去。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1811
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_f34cbb18:

    # gizel shy "I have nothing of value, mister... I'm just a poor girl. Please, leave me be..."
    gizel shy "先生，我一无所有……我只是个穷姑娘。请您放过我吧……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1813
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_4f7b9db9:

    # you "Uh, me? Don't worry, I'm just a friend. I came to warn you."
    you "啊,我?别担心,我只是个朋友。我来是想警告你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1815
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_11e7f22c:

    # gizel surprise "W... Warn me?"
    gizel surprise "警告我？"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1817
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_bcdc08d6:

    # you "There's this party of templars outside, and I think they're looking for you."
    you "外面有一支圣殿骑士的巡逻队,我想他们可能在找你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1819
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_d756a71e:

    # "You hear that muffled sound again coming from downstairs."
    "你再次听到了从楼下传来的模糊声音。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1821
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_e42ef776:

    # you "Wait a minute... What exactly are you doing here?"
    you "等等...你到底在这里做什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1823
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_d272840f:

    # gizel upset "That's none of your... "
    gizel upset "那与你无关……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1825
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_2bca85df:

    # gizel surprise "Wait, what did you just say? Templars???"
    gizel surprise "等等，你刚才说什么？圣殿骑士？？？"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1827
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_aa3bf8d3:

    # "You hear a strong, commanding voice coming from just outside."
    "你听到一个强有力、指挥有力的声音从外面传来。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1829
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_567bea9e:

    # man "If our information is correct, it must be around here."
    man "如果我们的信息是正确的,它一定就在这附近。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1831
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_944f29d1:

    # man "Men, search every house!" with vpunch
    man "男人们，搜遍每一栋房子！" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1833
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_b172031e:

    # gizel upset "Demons!"
    gizel upset "恶魔！"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1835
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_eba3c76b:

    # "Jumping to her feet, the girl runs out of the house, only to bump right into one of the armored initiates."
    "女孩飞快地跳起来从房子里跑了出去,结果一头撞上一个穿甲衣的新兵。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1839
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_06e1afe5:

    # gizel "Ouch!" with vpunch
    gizel "哎哟!" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1841
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_aadc3f2a:

    # initiate "Hey!"
    initiate "嘿!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1845
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_acb83716:

    # initiate "Brother knight! Look what I just found!"
    initiate "兄弟们!看看我发现了什么!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1849
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_a098c56e:

    # templar "Well, well... What do we have here?"
    templar "嗯哼...你找到什么宝贝了?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1851
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_62726b0f:

    # gizel shy "Mister, I don't understand..."
    gizel shy "先生，我不明白……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1853
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_fa209fb1:

    # templar "Seize her! And bring her accomplice too!"
    templar "逮捕她!还有她的同伙!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1855
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_cb8bb2a0:

    # you "Hey! I'm not..."
    you "嘿!我不是..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1857
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_416231f0:

    # initiate "Shut up. You're coming with us."
    initiate "闭嘴。老实跟我们走。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1861
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_b0cdbaa3:

    # "The initiates disarm you and shove you out of the hut following the elf girl."
    "士兵们夺走了你的武器,然后在精灵少女的带领下将你从小屋赶了出去。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1865
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_88ef28ba:

    # "Walking up to the group of armored templars, you salute the head knight, bowing as low as you can."
    "你走到一群身穿盔甲的圣殿骑士面前,尽可能深深地行礼致敬。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1867
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_8f208c38:

    # you "Hello, my lord, please allow me to introduce myself..."
    you "您好,骑士大人,请允许我自我介绍..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1869
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_06bcaf0d:

    # templar "What in Arios's name do you want? We're busy."
    templar "太阳神在上,你想说什么?我们正忙着呢。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1871
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_9193f912:

    # you "Busy, yes, I can see that. Then you wouldn't be interested in the whereabouts of a local elf, would you?"
    you "忙?是的,看的出来。那你们是否对一个精灵的下落感兴趣呢?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1873
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_fb894660:

    # templar "No, now..."
    templar "不,我没..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1875
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_b5565a89:

    # templar "Wait, what?" with vpunch
    templar "等等，什么？" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1877
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_f63a8237:

    # templar "Speak."
    templar "说。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1879
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_31410961:

    # you "A weird elf girl, young and slender, with pale hair and white skin. A spy, no doubt. I could show you the location of her hideout..."
    you "一个奇怪的年轻纤细的精灵少女,有着苍白的头发和白皙的皮肤。她毫无疑问是个间谍。我可以告诉你她的藏身之处..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1881
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_2b506383:

    # templar "That fits her description, all right. Take us there."
    templar "没错,她就长那样。带我们去找她。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1883
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_9e26e021:

    # you "Of course, of course... I trust I will be rewarded well for my trouble?"
    you "当然,当然...不过我是否能得到一些微薄的回报?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1885
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_cf55cfd6:

    # templar "..."
    templar "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:1887
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gizel2_4d97999f:

    # templar "Humph. All in due time, citizen. You will get your due."
