translate chinese_simplified gizel_attack_e51eeb25:

    # gizel normal "Then, I have a task for you. It is of the utmost importance that you don't fail me."
    gizel normal "那么，我有个任务要交给你。你千万不能让我失望，这一点至关重要。"

