translate chinese_simplified gizel_attack_eb5ab0a8:

    # gizel normal "So, in exchange for your life, you will find me a secure hideout."
    gizel normal "所以，你得用你的性命来换取我一个安全的藏身之处。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2909
translate chinese_simplified gizel_attack_2a1aa01f:

    # gizel "I need somewhere private, away from prying eyes... I have too many neighbours here, and I can't change them all into slugs."
    gizel "我需要一个私密的地方,远离好奇的眼睛...这里太多邻居了,我不可能把他们全变成蜗牛。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2914
translate chinese_simplified gizel_attack_8e09c87f:

