    # gizel upset "If you must."
    gizel upset "如果你非要这么做的话。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2924
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_8f48e0c7:

    # you "Who are you?"
    you "你是谁?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2926
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_0dd69a0b:

    # gizel normal "Why, I'm Gizel, of course."
    gizel normal "当然，我就是吉泽尔。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2928
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_3a9e36a1:

    # gizel "You might also know me as the White Witch of the North, the Deathly Bride, or Gizelinde the man-eater."
    gizel "你也可能听说过我是北方的白女巫、死亡新娘,或者食人魔Gizelinde。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2930
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_8aea568e:

    # gizel "I don't actually eat man meat though."
    gizel "不过我并不真的吃人肉。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2932
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_0cecf997:

    # gizel smirk "Or rather, I do, but not in {i}{b}that{/b}{/i} way... *smirk*"
    gizel smirk "或者更确切地说，我的确有这种感觉，但不是那种感觉……*得意地笑*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2934
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_949c00f8:

    # you "Never heard of you."
    you "从未听说过你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2936
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_d806152b:

    # gizel upset "Humph. That's just a testament to your appalling cluelessness and ignorance!"
    gizel upset "哼。这只能说明你真是愚昧无知！"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2938
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_e5e572a9:

    # gizel normal "I have roamed this world for a very long time, lived a longer life than you could ever dream..."
    gizel normal "我在这世上游历了很久很久，活得比你想象的还要长……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2940
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_a0abd3b0:

    # you "Well, it is true that elves have longer lifespans..."
    you "这倒是事实,精灵的寿命确实更长..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2944
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_f2eb3c26:

    # gizel smirk "Elves? Don't make me laugh."
    gizel smirk "精灵？别逗我笑了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2946
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_fb60e28c:

    # gizel angry "I despise my cutesy relatives, what with their tree-hugging lifestyle and their syrupy morals! I hate the little fuckers."
    gizel angry "我讨厌我那些装可爱的亲戚，他们整天拥抱树木，道德观也甜腻腻的！我恨死这些小混蛋了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2948
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_dde03a74:

    # gizel "I am a Drut, a pale elf, last of a breed that vanished centuries ago."
    gizel "我是一名德鲁特,一名苍白的精灵,这个种族早已在几个世纪前消失了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2950
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_513ad74d:

    # gizel smirk "I have no more in common with those moronic wood elves than a white shark with a goldfish."
    gizel smirk "我跟那些愚蠢的木精灵之间没有任何共同之处，就像大白鲨跟金鱼之间没有任何共同之处一样。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2952
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_ebc9441e:

    # gizel normal "No, if I have lived to be this old, never-aging, the reason is much more elegant and simple: sorcery."
    gizel normal "不，如果我能活到这么大年纪，而且永葆青春，那么原因就更加优雅和简单了：魔法。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2954
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_ddf68d91:

    # you "Oh... H... How?"
    you "哦...那...是怎么做到的?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2956
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_83f99523:

    # gizel smirk "Well, it's quite simple really. A bath every fortnight in virgin blood does the trick quite well."
    gizel smirk "其实很简单。每两周用处女血洗一次澡，效果就很好。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2958
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_61fac9c4:

    # you "V-virgin blood???" with vpunch
    you "V-处女血？？？" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2962
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_b5477ee7:

    # gizel smirk "Ha! You should see the look on your face!"
    gizel smirk "哈哈！你应该看看你当时的表情！"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2964
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_960c59ee:

    # gizel normal "Come on, I'm fucking with you. Do you know how {i}{b}rare{/b}{/i} real virgins are in Xeros? I wouldn't have lasted a year at this rate."
    gizel normal "别闹了，我开玩笑的。你知道Xeros里真正的处男有多少吗？照你这速度，我一年都坚持不下去。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2971
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_e0ae58ca:

    # you "What are you doing here in Zan?"
    you "你来泽恩这里做什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2973
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_3099cb06:

    # gizel normal "For centuries, I stuck to the wilderness outside of city walls, and it suited me just fine... After all, my kin used to live high in what you call the Arik mountains, and it was pretty much inaccessible."
    gizel normal "几个世纪以来，我一直生活在城墙外的荒野中，这对我来说很合适……毕竟，我的族人过去居住在你们所说的阿里克山脉的高处，那里几乎与世隔绝。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2976
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_83b40cb1:

    # gizel "But I didn't stay there long. I had my reasons... Anyway."
    gizel "但我没有长居那里。我有我自己的理由...总之。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2978
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_2e78af4a:

    # gizel angry "After the fall of the old races, humans began to multiply and spread like roaches... It was harder and harder to find a quiet place to live and feed."
    gizel angry "旧种族灭亡后，人类开始像蟑螂一样繁殖扩散……寻找安静的居住和觅食之地变得越来越困难。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2981
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_f50b2b40:

    # gizel upset "And now, there's the damn war. Arios bigot crusaders swarm the land, eager to find elves to string up and villages to loot on the way to the front line, trying to delay real fighting for as long as possible..."
    gizel upset "现在，该死的战争爆发了。阿瑞俄斯的偏执十字军蜂拥而至，他们急于寻找精灵来吊死，沿途劫掠村庄，前往前线，试图尽可能地拖延真正的战斗……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2983
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_f3c0a045:

    # gizel normal "Life in the country went from being hard to impossible. I thought I might as well hide in plain sight, in the big city..."
    gizel normal "乡下的生活从艰难变得难以忍受。我想，不如就躲在大城市里，隐姓埋名吧……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2985
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_9e093621:

    # gizel angry "That didn't work out so well."
    gizel angry "结果并不理想。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2991
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_da23c0db:

    # you "What... What did you just do to those men out there?"
    you "你刚刚对外面那些人做了什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2993
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_71db8cc1:

    # gizel normal "Well, I just used the Kamehame-boom, an ancient bolt of doom technique taught to me by my master..."
    gizel normal "我刚才用了龟派气功，这是我师傅教我的古老绝技……"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2995
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_23c2a7aa:

    # gizel smirk "Beginner's stuff, really."
    gizel smirk "真是入门级的东西。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:2998
translate chinese_simplified gizel_questions_menu_cdae0279:

    # you "No, I mean, you did something to them before that... They couldn't move or think."
    you "不,我是说在那之前,你对他们做了什么...他们动弹不得,也无法思考。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:3000
