# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4394
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_f6b81e16:

    # you "Hey there, sister, are you hurt?"
    you "嗨,姑娘,你受伤了吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4396
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_acfd8211:

    # gina "I think... Uh..."
    gina "我想...呃..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4398
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_b5511013:

    # gina "I'll be all right..."
    gina "我会没事的..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4400
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_0a8844a8:

    # "It seems that her 'wings' broke her fall at least a little."
    "看来她的'机翼'至少减缓了坠落的冲击。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4402
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_dc81a8c5:

    # you "She must be tougher than she looks..."
    you "她看起来比外表坚韧得多..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4408
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_9a30d019:

    # you "Hey, you! Are you fucking out of your mind?"
    you "嘿,你!你是疯了吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4410
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_0c40d594:

    # gina "Uh... Beg your pardon?"
    gina "呃...不好意思?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4412
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_051eea0b:

    # you "Jumping up from on high like that! Are you trying to die!"
    you "从那么高的地方跳下来!你想死吗!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4414
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_2840c23b:

    # gina "Uh? Of course not, silly!"
    gina "啊?当然不是,傻瓜!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4416
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_a1a49e67:

    # gina "It's all part of a grand scientific experiment, way too complicated to understand..."
    gina "这是一个非常复杂的科学实验的一部分,你肯定理解不了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4418
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_7a6c1dfa:

    # you "You're trying to fly, aren't you."
    you "你在试图飞行,对吗。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4422
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_d0dfe71a:

    # gina "YES!" with vpunch
    gina "是的！" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4424
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_ff8d396d:

    # gina "How did you guess? Are you perhaps a fellow scientist?"
    gina "你怎么猜到的?难道你也是个科学家吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4426
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_f557afc5:

    # you "Uh, no... I don't see the appeal of jumping to your death using failing technology..."
    you "呃,不是...我看不出从失败的技术中跳下去自杀的吸引力..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4428
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_1d3624e9:

    # gina "Failing technology? FAILING TECHNOLOGY?" with vpunch
    gina "技术失效？技术失效？" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4430
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_dcce2928:

    # gina "Are you mad! Look at these composite wings! They're a thing of beauty, aren't they? It's Cimerian tech!"
    gina "你疯了吗!看看这些复合翼!它们多么美丽动人!这是塞米里亚的科技!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4432
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_51c90063:

    # "You take a closer look at the roundish appendices floating above the girl's shoulders. It's unlike anything you've ever seen. Definitely not man-made technology, as far as you can tell."
    "你仔细观察那些飘浮在女孩肩膀上的圆形附肢。这绝对不是人类制造的技术,从你所知来看。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4435
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_e4017639:

    # you "You... You made this?"
    you "你...你自己做出来的?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4437
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_8e040dff:

    # "She stands up, beaming with pride."
    "她站起来,洋溢着骄傲的神情。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4439
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_40b58bf2:

    # gina "I sure did!"
    gina "没错,就是我做出来的!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4441
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_1364120b:

    # gina "Well, uh..."
    gina "嗯,呃..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4443
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_4e8fb181:

    # gina "Actually, {i}recycled{/i} might be a better word... But in layman's terms, sure, I {i}{b}made{/b}{/i} it. Isn't it awesome?"
    gina "实际上,{i}回收利用{/i}可能更贴切点...不过用平常人的话说,是{i}{b}我做出来的{/b}{/i}。很棒吧?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4445
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_57d43c9b:

    # you "Well, it would be... If it actually allowed you to fly..."
    you "如果它真的能让你飞起来的话,那就确实很棒了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4447
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_765c2272:

    # gina "What? Didn't you notice? I {i}{b}soared{/b}{/i}! I mean, sure, I fell, but for a moment, it worked, and I was flying! That's right! FLYING!"
    gina "什么?你难道没注意到吗?我{i}{b}腾空而起{/b}{/i}了!我是说,当然也摔下来了,但有那么一刻我真的在飞!没错!我在飞!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4449
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_7c4b7397:

    # you "Well, I don't think people will be very interested in wings that only work for a split-second before they let you fall down to your death."
    you "但是,人们恐怕不会对那种只能短暂工作就会让你摔下去的翅膀感兴趣。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4451
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_92ed75f6:

    # gina "Humph! How short-sighted of you. I can see that you are completely lacking in scientific spirit."
    gina "哼!你这种短视的想法真让人失望。看来你完全缺乏科学精神。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4453
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_eac1d773:

    # "You take a skeptical look at her flapping metal-wings."
    "你怀着怀疑的眼光看着她的金属翅膀。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4455
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_ae25a0a7:

    # you "Say, why don't you make those wings larger? Maybe you could keep gliding longer if they were larger?"
    you "说起来,你怎么不做大一些的翅膀呢?如果更大一些,也许你就能更长时间地滑翔了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4457
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_03c8fc65:

    # gina "Larger wings? LARGER WINGS? HA!"
    gina "更大的翅膀?更大的翅膀?哈!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4459
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_ea655aa1:

    # gina "HA!"
    gina "哈!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4463
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_299c3c37:

    # gina "HAHAHAHA!"
    gina "哈哈哈哈!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4465
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_a52385db:

    # you "What's so funny?"
    you "有什么好笑的?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4467
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_877d838a:

    # gina "Oh, my, you're so ignorant of basic scientific principles..."
    gina "噢,天哪,你真是对基本科学原理一无所知..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4469
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_2c48e161:

    # gina "Think for a minute. Larger wings mean more {b}weight{/b}. More weight means it's harder to {b}fly{/b}!"
    gina "想一想吧。翅膀越大,重量就越{b}重{/b}。重量越重,{b}飞{/b}得就越困难!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4471
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_820d8002:

    # gina "It's obvious to anyone that's ever studied the question that to properly fly, you need very tiny, light wings. The tinier the better."
    gina "任何研究过这个问题的人都知道,要想真正飞行,需要的是非常小巧,轻盈的翅膀。越小越好。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4473
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_40bc22d8:

    # you "Really?"
    you "真的吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4475
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_0e87e786:

    # gina "Of course! Think of the animal kingdom. What is the most magnificent flying animal you know?"
    gina "当然!想想动物界吧。你知道最厉害的飞行生物是什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4477
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_cb4db79c:

    # you "Well, uh... There's the royal eagle... Griffins... Dragons..."
    you "嗯,呃...皇家雄鹰...狮鹫...龙..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4481
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_ee22fd69:

    # gina "Nonsense!!! I'm talking about the mosquito!"
    gina "胡说!我说的是蚊子!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4483
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_1bbc923f:

    # you "The mosquito?"
    you "蚊子?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4485
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_8a6f30e5:

    # gina "Of course, dummy!"
    gina "当然,笨蛋!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4487
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_9dc8f164:

    # gina "The mosquito is the most perfect, wonderful creation of the gods, it's so tiny, and yet flies so beautifully, in all directions..."
    gina "蚊子是上天最完美、最美妙的创造,它那么小,却能如此优美地飞来飞去..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4489
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_cd53c265:

    # gina "You can spend a whole night trying to swat it, and it will always elude you!"
    gina "你可以整夜试图拍打它,但它总能逃脱你的追捕!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4491
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_b8c8ad4a:

    # gina "The mosquito is a wondrous creature indeed... Its buzzing sound is the very sound of {i}progress{/i}!"
    gina "蚊子确实是一种神奇的生物...它的蜂鸣声就是{i}进步{/i}的声音!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4493
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_37351b69:

    # you "Ahem, well... I had certainly never seen mosquitos in that way..."
    you "唔,嗯...我从未用这种方式看待蚊子..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4495
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_eca03882:

    # gina "You can thank me later. For now, I need to repair those composite wings..."
    gina "以后再谢我。现在,我需要修复那些复合翼..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4497
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_e09510ec:

    # gina "But damn if I haven't run out of Cimerian components. These repeated crashes have taken a toll..."
    gina "但我已经没有席米亚元件了。这些重复的坠机事故已经造成了不小的损失..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4499
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_fb2ca384:

    # you "Repeated?"
    you "重复的?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4501
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_9f59936c:

    # gina "And now, all I've got is a dozen stupid crates, full of perverted machines..."
    gina "现在我只剩下一堆愚蠢的箱子,里面全是变态的机器..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4503
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_a7876793:

    # you "Uh? Perverted machines?"
    you "什么?变态的机器?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4505
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_17ea5485:

    # gina "Yes... Magically infused apparatuses, thrown away after they burnt some Karkyr enchantress at the stake..."
    gina "是的...那些注入魔法的装置,在一个卡尔基亚魔女被处死后被丢弃了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4507
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_f845692a:

    # gina "I recovered it. I used to dismantle them and re-use the components for my experiments..."
    gina "我把它们找了回来。我以前会拆开它们,重复利用部件进行实验..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4509
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_09d58350:

    # gina "It's great if you need pistons. For some reason, they're chockfull of those."
    gina "如果你需要活塞倒是很不错。不知为什么,它们总是装满了这些东西。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4511
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_09dfa18f:

    # you "Really..."
    you "真的..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4513
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_a8ffb97b:

    # gina "What am I gonna do? Cimerian scrap is so expensive these days..."
    gina "我该怎么办?席米亚废料现在价格被炒的很高..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4515
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_685847ec:

    # you "Well..."
    you "嗯..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4517
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_a323fa67:

    # you "Listen. I might be able to offer you a deal."
    you "听着。也许我能给你一个交易的机会。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4519
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_28df1d18:

    # gina "A deal? What deal?"
    gina "达成协议？什么交易？"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4521
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_fa933748:

    # you "What if you sold me some of those, er, useless sex machines on the cheap... Er, I mean, at market value for the junk it is, haha..."
    you "要是你能以便宜点的价格卖给我一些那些,呃,无用的性机器...我是说,按废料价格算,哈哈..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4523
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_a41a7af2:

    # gina "You'd buy them?"
    gina "你要买它们?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4525
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_482a16c7:

    # you "Sure."
    you "别急。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4527
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_f0be6b37:

    # gina "Why, ok, I can do that!"
    gina "哇,好的,我可以这样做!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4529
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_3ad22163:

    # you "Fantastic. We're in business, then!"
    you "太棒了。那我们就达成交易了!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4531
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_d1eb1f4a:

    # gina "Deal! My name is Gina. Come by here anytime, and I'll fix some of those machines for you. So you can, uh, enjoy yourself."
    gina "成交!我叫吉娜。随时来找我,我会修理一些这样的机器给你。这样你就可以,呃,好好享受了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4535
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_d3f65cc6:

    # you "I'm [MC.name]. And, uh, it's not for me, it's for a friend..."
    you "我是[MC.name]。呃,这不是为了我,是为了一个朋友..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4537
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_4701ea51:

    # gina "Yeah, yeah, sure. Whatever floats your boat, pal..."
    gina "是是是,无所谓啦,随你怎么说..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4539
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_59a40bde:

    # gina "But listen. If you ever run into Cimerian technology, anything you can find, I'm buying, and I will pay well. Seriously."
    gina "不过听着。如果你碰到任何席米亚科技,不管什么,我都会买下,而且价格很好。说真的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4541
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_b0f511a1:

    # you "I'll remember that."
    you "我会记住的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4550
translate chinese_simplified farm_meet_gina_1712f969:

    # "You may now buy {b}machines{/b} at the junkyard."
    "你现在可以在废品场购买{b}机器{/b}了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4561
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_10a8d97d:

    # "Curiosity finally gets the better of you, and you decide to visit Gina the Scientist in the Warehouse district."
    "好奇心终于战胜了你,你决定去工业区拜访吉娜科学家。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4563
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_aab438f9:

    # you "Willow gave me this address... This building looks like a ruin... It must be abandoned."
    you "薇儿给了我这个地址...这幢建筑看起来像个废墟...一定是被弃置了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4565
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_4d8c871c:

    # you "Maybe I should just..."
    you "也许我应该就这么......"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4567
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_732dd4d5:

    # "Girl's voice" "Heeeeey! [MC.name]!!!"
    "女孩的声音" "Heeeeey! [MC.name]!!!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4569
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_cdd9076e:

    # you "Uh?"
    you "啊?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4571
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_ec19023f:

    # "Looking up, you see Gina, standing precariously on edge of the building's fourth floor."
    "抬头一看,你看到吉娜站在建筑四楼的边缘,一副摇摇欲坠的样子。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4573
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_4a1fd20d:

    # you "Gina! Don't jump!"
    you "吉娜!别跳下去!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4575
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_e56c75bc:

    # gina "This is not that kind of experiment, silly. Get up here."
    gina "这不是那种实验,笨蛋。上来这里。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4581
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_048bb10a:

    # gina "So, here you are! I've been waiting a long time!"
    gina "你终于来了!我等你很久了!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4583
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_bf910604:

    # you "Uh, hi. Why did you call me..."
    you "呃,嗨。你为什么找我来..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4585
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_00a780d7:

    # you "UWAAAH!!!"
    you "呀啊!!!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4587
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_9ffc1616:

    # "In the corner of the derelict room, a gooey, vaguely translucid monster is wobbling. It looks like a blob of brownish jelly."
    "在凌乱的房间一角,有一个模糊、半透明的怪物正在摇晃。看起来像一团棕色果冻一样。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4589
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_1b25d02e:

    # you "Monster!" with vpunch
    you "怪物！" with vpunch

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4591
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_e91f0f49:

    # gina "Cut it out..."
    gina "别闹..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4593
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_d657b719:

    # gina "This is not a 'monster'. This is a {i}lubricus plugginus{/i}. I call him 'Test Subject #1'."
    gina "这不是'怪物'。这是一只{i}润滑性塞子{/i}。我叫它'实验体#1'。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4595
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_6259b7de:

    # you "That's not very, err, personal..."
    you "这名字太不个人化了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4597
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_766fc447:

    # gina "Shut up, Test Subject #2. We have much to do."
    gina "闭嘴,实验体#2。我们有很多事要做。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4599
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_477da730:

    # you "I don't like this..."
    you "我不喜欢这样..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4601
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_a34ebf0b:

    # gina "Yeah yeah, grab the book behind you will you?"
    gina "是啊,快去拿那边工作台上的那本书吧。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4603
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_21c12f0e:

    # "She gestures towards a dusty leatherbound tome on a workbench nearby. You try to decipher its title."
    "她朝附近一本布满灰尘的皮面书示意。你试着破译书名。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4605
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_f24abae2:

    # you "Ne... Cro... No... Mi-con. What gibberish is this?"
    you "呃... 尸...的...通-。这是什么鬼东西?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4607
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_3ff8b876:

    # gina "It's a book about ancient science and magic. Apparently it was translated many times over from its original Cimerian. I use it for my most advanced research."
    gina "这是一本关于古代科学和魔法的书。显然它从原版西米利安语翻译过来了很多次。我用它来做最高级的研究。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:4609
translate chinese_simplified gina_research_55aedb99:

