# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17198
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_218c6bd3:

    # bast "I was made to... You see, I was young and inexperienced, and I screwed up, badly. This was the only way to atone for it."
    bast "我被要求这么做的... 你看,我年轻无经验,搞砸了很多事。这是我唯一的赎罪方式。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17200
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_0e944e82:

    # you "Really? What happened?"
    you "真的吗?发生了什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17202
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_9c8a9afb:

    # "Her mood darkens."
    "她的情绪变得阴郁。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17204
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_3e353557:

    # bast "Well... Nothing you need to be concerned with. *frown*"
    bast "嗯...这不是你需要担心的事情。*皱眉*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17206
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_82c32674:

    # bast "Anyway, you didn't come here only to chat?"
    bast "总之,你来这里不仅仅是聊天吧?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17210
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_1da8cad7:

    # bast "This is the resource exchange! The biggest one of its kind in Zan, and maybe the world. I wouldn't know about that."
    bast "这里是资源交易所!是整个泽恩最大的,也可能是世界上最大的。至于这个我可不太清楚。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17212
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_40122cac:

    # you "What do you do here?"
    you "在这里可以做些什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17214
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_cb4ca046:

    # bast "We exchange a wide range of building goods for the convenience of builders in the city."
    bast "我们交换各种建筑材料,方便城里的建造者们。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17216
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_03f483bc:

    # bast "If you have too much of one resource, not enough of another, or simply want to buy or sell resources with hard cash, this is the place."
    bast "如果你有某些资源太多,另一些资源太少,或者只是想用现金买卖资源,这里就是个好地方。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17218
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_c9d98a3d:

    # you "Resources?"
    you "资源?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17220
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_856149cc:

    # bast "Building resources. Wood, leather, that sort of thing."
    bast "建筑资源。木头、皮革之类的东西。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17222
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_96416e6e:

    # you "Are the rates good?"
    you "价格公道吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17224
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_1901e7db:

    # bast "Well, they're good enough, I guess. Trading here is better than selling and buying resources for gold, that's for sure."
    bast "嗯,总的来说还算公道。在这里交易资源比直接用黄金买卖要好得多。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17226
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_8bd781a1:

    # bast "But we do take our cut, of course."
    bast "不过我们也会抽取一定的佣金。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17228
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_cbfe27fc:

    # bast "That said, price depends on supply and demand... It changes every week."
    bast "当然,具体价格还取决于供给和需求...每周都会变动。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17230
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_02ff6320:

    # bast "Sometimes, prices are driven up for a given resource when we have a shortage. Sometimes they are driven down, when the resource is plentiful."
    bast "有时候,某种资源短缺时价格会被拉高。有时候资源充足时又会被压低。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17232
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_8bb00932:

    # you "I see..."
    you "我明白了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17234
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_9296eebe:

    # bast "Is that all?"
    bast "就这些吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17238
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_1772d85e:

    # you "I want to trade resources here. Can I?"
    you "我想在这里交易资源。可以吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17240
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_93bc1462:

    # bast "Why, sure."
    bast "当然可以。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17242
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_e8a222d0:

    # you "Yay!"
    you "耶!咳咳...我是说好的"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17244
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_79631173:

    # bast "There's just the small matter of registration..."
    bast "不过还有一个小问题,就是注册..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17246
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_cd8b6613:

    # you "Uh? Registration?"
    you "啊?注册?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17248
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_0d031ccf:

    # bast "Yes. A holy builder has to grant you a proper license before you can trade resources here."
    bast "没错。在你能在这里交易资源之前,必须得到一位圣徒建筑师发给你的正式许可证。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17250
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_41e0d1a8:

    # you "A holy builder? That means... You?"
    you "圣徒建筑师?也就是说...你?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17252
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_14ed6f46:

    # bast "Yep."
    bast "对的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17254
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_d0205dce:

    # you "All right! Can I get one? Please?"
    you "好啊!我可以现在就办理吗?拜托了!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17256
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_152bcdc5:

    # bast "Sure, but not for free."
    bast "当然可以,不过不是免费的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17258
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_209adabb:

    # you "Damn. I figured you might say that."
    you "真是的,我就知道你会这么说。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17260
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_c026f283:

    # bast "You need to contribute to our emergency stockpile before I can give you a basic builder license."
    bast "在我给你颁发基本的建筑师执照之前,你需要为我们的应急储备做出贡献。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17262
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_20ed9f49:

    # bast "That would be 5 bundles of wood, 5 wads of leather, and 5 batches of dye."
    bast "具体需要5捆木头、5捆皮革和5批染料。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17264
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_8bb00932_1:

    # you "I see..."
    you "我明白了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17273
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_7aeb1fa4:

    # bast "...three, four, five... Alright. Thanks. Here is your builder license."
    bast "...三、四、五...好的,谢谢。这里是你的建筑师执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17275
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_92eea70d:

    # "You have received a {b}basic builder license{/b}."
    "你已获得{b}初级建筑师执照{/b}。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17277
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_84f274c1:

    # bast "You can now trade common resources like wood, leather and dye here."
    bast "现在你可以在这里交易普通资源,如木材、皮革和染料。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17279
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_4904494d:

    # bast "It doesn't seem like you have those resources with you now. Come back later, maybe?"
    bast "看起来你现在没有这些资源。回头再来吧。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17282
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_6158d353:

    # you "Ok, I'll leave you to... whatever it is you're doing."
    you "好的,我就让你自己忙去吧。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17284
translate chinese_simplified resource_exchange_menu_51e928f3:

    # bast "Yeah. See ya."
    bast "嗯,再见。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17304
translate chinese_simplified exchange_come_back_499146c7:

    # bast "Oh, it's you again. Did you have any more questions?"
    bast "哦,又是你。还有什么问题吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17313
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_120bef34:

    # bast "Hi! I have a new builder license to offer, if you're interested."
    bast "嗨!如果你感兴趣,我这里有新的建筑师执照可以提供。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17316
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_5ca01007:

    # bast "Do you want an upgraded builder license?" nointeract
    bast "您是否需要升级到建筑许可证？" nointeract

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17319
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_5018cd81:

    # you "Upgrade my license? What for?"
    you "升级执照?有什么用处吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17323
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_b19c4f18:

    # bast "Right now, you can only trade common resources at the exchange."
    bast "目前你只能在交易所交易普通资源。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17325
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_4357d43e:

    # bast "But if you subscribe to an advanced builder license, you can deal with rarer and more expensive resources, like marble, silk and ore."
    bast "但如果你购买高级建筑师执照,就可以交易更稀有和更贵重的资源,如大理石、丝绸和矿石。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17327
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我明白了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17329
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_61d5e22f:

    # bast "The cost is 5 blocks of marble, 5 rolls of silk, and 5 chunks of ore."
    bast "需要支付5块大理石、5卷丝绸和5块矿石。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17338
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_7aeb1fa4:

    # bast "...three, four, five... Alright. Thanks. Here is your builder license."
    bast "...三、四、五...好的,谢谢。这里是你的建筑师执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17340
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_38d4488c:

    # "You have received an {b}advanced builder license{/b}."
    "你已获得{b}高级建筑师执照{/b}。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17342
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_1b940f11:

    # bast "You can now trade rare resources like marble, ore and silk."
    bast "现在你可以交易稀有资源,如大理石、矿石和丝绸。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17346
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_c852f1e1:

    # bast "If you want to trade diamonds, the most valuable building resource, you will need a master builder license."
    bast "如果你想交易钻石,最珍贵的建筑资源,你需要大师级建筑师执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17348
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_32a5754c:

    # bast "It's quite costly... I require 2 diamonds."
    bast "这需要很大代价...我需要2颗钻石。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17350
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_530163a8:

    # you "Two diamonds! *cough* *cough*"
    you "两颗钻石!*咳嗽**咳嗽*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17352
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_16bf1658:

    # bast "Yep. But diamond traders make the most money. Consider this an investment."
    bast "是的。但钻石交易商挣得最多。把这当做一种投资。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17361
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_2107e539:

    # bast "Ooh... Shiny! Thanks. Here is your builder license."
    bast "哦...真漂亮!谢谢。这里是你的建筑师执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17363
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_d7b538e2:

    # "You have received a {b}master builder license{/b}."
    "你已获得{b}特级建筑师执照{/b}。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17365
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_3b458cf3:

    # bast "You can now trade diamonds at the resource exchange."
    bast "现在你可以在资源交易所中交易钻石了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17368
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_4384bb26:

    # you "I want to upgrade my license."
    you "我想升级我的执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17372
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_61d5e22f_1:

    # bast "The cost is 5 blocks of marble, 5 rolls of silk, and 5 chunks of ore."
    bast "需要支付5块大理石、5卷丝绸和5块矿石。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17381
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_7aeb1fa4_1:

    # bast "...three, four, five... Alright. Thanks. Here is your builder license."
    bast "...三、四、五...好的,谢谢。这里是你的建筑师执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17383
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_38d4488c_1:

    # "You have received an {b}advanced builder license{/b}."
    "你已获得{b}高级建筑师执照{/b}。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17385
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_1b940f11_1:

    # bast "You can now trade rare resources like marble, ore and silk."
    bast "现在你可以交易稀有资源,如大理石、矿石和丝绸。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17389
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_525a812c:

    # bast "It will cost you 2 diamonds. I don't wanna know how you get them..."
    bast "需要支付2颗钻石。我不想知道你是怎么得到它们的..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17398
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_2107e539_1:

    # bast "Ooh... Shiny! Thanks. Here is your builder license."
    bast "哦...真漂亮!谢谢。这里是你的建筑师执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17400
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_d7b538e2_1:

    # "You have received a {b}master builder license{/b}."
    "你已获得{b}特级建筑师执照{/b}。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17402
translate chinese_simplified new_builder_license_3b458cf3_1:

    # bast "You can now trade diamonds at the resource exchange."
    bast "现在你可以在资源交易所中交易钻石了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17442
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_d6ab8c6e:

    # bast "8, 9, 10... Well, that's a bunch."
    bast "8,9,10...这可真是不少。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17444
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_eda5f1d7:

    # bast "Good to see you are using your license."
    bast "很高兴看到你在使用你的执照。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17450
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_3ce660f1:

    # you "Well, to be honest, I mostly come here to see you..."
    you "说实话,我主要是来这里见你的..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17452
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_abad86e5:

    # bast "Uh? What do you mean?"
    bast "啊?你什么意思?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17454
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_950e8173:

    # you "Well, obviously, you're super hot. And your guild uniform... I have a thing for uniforms."
    you "很明显,你超级辣。还有你的公会制服...我就爱这种制服。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17456
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_793ef35d:

    # "She looks at you, unimpressed."
    "她看着你,面无表情。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17458
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_5395329a:

    # bast "Well, if that's your reason for coming and doing business here, I'm not going to argue with that."
    bast "好吧,如果这就是你来这里做生意的原因,我也不会反对。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17460
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_6779c82c:

    # bast "But don't get your hopes too high. I get hit on all the bloody time, and I have no patience for it. *frown*"
    bast "但不要太有希望。我经常被人搭讪,我对此很没耐心。*皱眉*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17467
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_0c934f1d:

    # you "You said you were a Holy Builder, correct?"
    you "你说你是位圣建筑师,对吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17469
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_7a876806:

    # bast "Yes."
    bast "是的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17471
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_9922f464:

    # you "You mentioned something about being elected to atone for your mistake... Can you tell me what happened?"
    you "你提到被选中为自己的错误赎罪...你能告诉我发生了什么吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17473
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_fb2642b4:

    # bast "What's it to you?"
    bast "关你什么事？"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17475
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_d1303c16:

    # you "Well... Curiosity, I guess. I just wanted to know you better."
    you "嗯...好奇心吧。我只是想更了解你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17477
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_2bd72773:

    # bast "That's not a topic I want to talk about."
    bast "这不是我想谈论的话题。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17484
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_cb652329:

    # you "So, I've been a good customer, eh..."
    you "所以,我一直都是个好客户,是吧..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17486
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_382ff4b1:

    # you "Can I get a rebate?"
    you "我能得到回扣吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17488
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_2c8b2e8d:

    # bast "No."
    bast "不知道。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17490
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_d2c4c158:

    # you "Please?"
    you "拜托?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17492
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_2c8b2e8d_1:

    # bast "No."
    bast "不知道。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17494
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_e801c3bf:

    # you "What if I traded more with you?"
    you "如果我跟你多做生意,会怎样?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17496
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_3f162d0a:

    # bast "Sure, why don't you do that first."
    bast "好啊,你先试试看。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17500
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_20c5f3c7:

    # bast "Hey, you! Where do you think that camel is going!"
    bast "喂,你!那头骆驼要去哪里!"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17502
translate chinese_simplified trade_10_resources_731e8d09:

    # bast "Sorry, I'm busy. Catch you later."
    bast "抱歉,我很忙。改天再聊。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17510
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_6c6d520b:

    # bast "Over 25 resources... That's a lot to trade in one go! Well done."
    bast "超过25件资源...一次性交易这么多!干得漂亮。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17512
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_dd25a54d:

    # you "Yes. It's like we've reached a new stage in our relationship."
    you "是的。就好像我们的关系进入了新的阶段。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17514
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_1d473b52:

    # bast "Err... Yes. Our {i}business{/i} relationship."
    bast "呃...是的。我们的{i}商业{/i}关系。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17516
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_04dbdc0d:

    # you "I think I deserve a reward."
    you "我觉得我应该得到奖励。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17522
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_24831597:

    # you "Why not give me a big kiss to celebrate our friendship? Come to daddy..."
    you "为什么不给我一个深情的吻来庆祝我们的友谊呢?来吧,亲爱的..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17524
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_58e0694a:

    # bast "One step closer and I'll stab you."
    bast "再靠近一步我就捅你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17526
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_8040c233:

    # you "*gulp*"
    you "*咽口水*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17533
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_343daae7:

    # you "Look, I know you don't like to talk about your past..."
    you "听着,我知道你不太愿意谈论你的过去..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17535
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_977c502f:

    # bast "I don't. Piss off..."
    bast "没什么好说的,滚开..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17537
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_8524816d:

    # you "Wait, wait, I'm not going to ask about that. But I was wondering if you could tell me more about you... Maybe something about your duties? As a Holy Builder?"
    you "等等,等等,我不会问那个的。但我确实很好奇,你能不能告诉我更多关于你自己的事?比如你的职责?作为一名神圣的建造者?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17539
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_aa2fd6c2:

    # "Bast relaxes a little."
    "巴斯稍稍放松了一些。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17541
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_e9b5f176:

    # bast "You're pretty damn curious, aren't you?"
    bast "你可真是爱打听别人的事,对吧?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17543
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_9593cb3c:

    # bast "Well..."
    bast "嗯..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17545
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_f793a7c0:

    # bast "The elders like to say that Holy Builders are the cornerstone of our community, but that's just a load of bullcrap. We're essentially a bunch of menial servants, always willing to do the odd jobs no else wants."
    bast "长老们总是说神圣的建造者是我们社区的基础,但那纯粹是一派胡言。我们实际上不过是一群杂役,总是愿意去做其他人不愿意做的脏活累活。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17547
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_3df4744b:

    # bast "At least that's how it goes in Zan, where I've been the one and only Holy Builder for the past 5 years. Maybe other Holy Builders have it better. I don't know."
    bast "至少在泽恩是这样的,过去5年里我一直是唯一的神圣建造者。也许其他地方的情况有所不同,我不知道。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17549
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_ddd069d9:

    # you "But... These 'elders' of yours... What do they do?"
    you "但是...你们这些'长老'究竟在做什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17553
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_095cf8cf:

    # "She laughs harshly."
    "她嘲笑般地笑了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17555
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_4dda7982:

    # bast "Why, they just sit on their ass, sleeping during service, boozing the rest of the time..."
    bast "哦,他们不过就是坐在那里打盹,其余时间都在酗酒..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17557
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_c08a097f:

    # bast "But they do remember to collect all the money I make every Sunday, of course... Not that I would have any use for it. The Order provides food and shelter, at least."
    bast "不过他们可记得每个星期日来收集我赚的所有钱,当然,我也用不到那些钱。教团至少为我提供了食物和住所。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17559
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_035919f6:

    # you "You seem very bitter. Why stay?"
    you "你看起来很怨愤。为什么还要留下来?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17561
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_302b4c51:

    # bast "Well, I..."
    bast "嗯,我..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17565
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_aecf7ca1:

    # bast "I'm sorry, that sounded too harsh. I owe a lot to the Order. I shouldn't bad-mouth the elders. Please forget it."
    bast "抱歉,刚才说得太过了。我欠教团很多,我不应该说这些长老的坏话。请当我什么都没说吧。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17567
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_a854b7f6:

    # you "You're still not going to tell me what happened to put you in this situation?"
    you "你还是不打算告诉我是什么原因把你带到了这种处境?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17569
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_a80c1f9f:

    # bast "Nah. I barely know you. Maybe another time."
    bast "算了吧。我对你也不太了解,也许下次吧。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17576
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_01e67f5f:

    # you "As I am such a good customer, perhaps I should be rewarded?"
    you "作为你的忠实客户,我是否应该得到一些奖赏?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17578
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_023eda5d:

    # bast "A reward, uh?"
    bast "奖赏,嗯?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17580
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_8690e697:

    # bast "Well, I've got some leftovers from the last caravan. You can pick what's useful to you. Saves me the trouble of cleaning up."
    bast "好吧,我上次从商队那里带回来了一些剩余物资。你可以挑些对你有用的东西拿走,这样也能帮我省点力。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17586
translate chinese_simplified trade_25_resources_d43e4d83:

    # bast "Now, if you'll excuse me, I've got some traders from Borgo to attend to."
    bast "现在,如果你不介意的话,我还有一些来自博尔戈的商人要招呼。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17594
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_112d1cff:

    # bast "50 resources exchanged at once... Color me impressed. You've come pretty far."
    bast "一次就兑换了50份资源...真是令人印象深刻。你的实力可不小啊。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17596
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_e246464c:

    # you "I have a lot of hidden resources..."
    you "我有很多隐藏的资源..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17598
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_17b1989e:

    # bast "I didn't think so at first, but now I'm inclined to believe you."
    bast "起初我还不太相信,但现在我倾向于相信你的话。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17605
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_ef910b6e:

    # you "I think we should celebrate. Why don't you take some time off and join me for drinks, or dinner?"
    you "我们应该庆祝一下。你要不要抽空和我一起喝几杯,或者共进晚餐?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17607
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_26ed2497:

    # "She looks at you warily."
    "她谨慎地看着你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17609
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_fbc89512:

    # bast "I don't like to be hit on on the job..."
    bast "我不喜欢在工作时被招惹..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17611
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_28fd2f31:

    # you "Come on, I'm just asking you to take off from work for a little while. Just a night out. No strings attached."
    you "拜托,我只是想让你请个假出来玩玩。就一个晚上的时间。没有任何隐藏目的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17613
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_946bfdb3:

    # bast "..."
    bast "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17617
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_64ec10d7:

    # "Bast looks around at the busy marketplace, hesitating. She looks old beyond her years. She seems exhausted."
