# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17619
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_2c302656:

    # you "Let someone else take care of business for today. Give yourself a break."
    you "让别人来处理一下生意吧,给自己放个假。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17621
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_9593cb3c:

    # bast "Well..."
    bast "嗯..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17623
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_95e0db1b:

    # bast "I guess this place can survive without me for a few hours. All right, where do you want to go? I never take a break, so I wouldn't know any trendy place..."
    bast "我想这里几个小时也能照常运转。好吧,那你想去哪里?我从来不休息,所以也不知道什么时髦去处..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17625
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_85f5500a:

    # you "Let us check this little tavern by the docks..."
    you "我们去码头边的那家小酒馆瞧瞧吧..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17629
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17635
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_becd137f:

    # bast "Well, it was nice. I rarely catch a break from work."
    bast "真是不错。我很少有如此轻松的时候。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17637
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_9f477a1d:

    # you "So it seems. This Holy Builder position seems like a chore..."
    you "看起来如此。圣建筑师的职位似乎就是一份苦差事..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17639
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_81915023:

    # bast "It is. But I brought it on myself, so I have no reason to complain."
    bast "确实如此。但这是我自己选的路,所以也没什么可抱怨的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17641
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_8ca19a00:

    # you "Have you, now? You still haven't told me the story."
    you "是吗?你还没有告诉我那个故事呢。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17643
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_40e99d68:

    # "Her mood darkens, and she stays silent for a while. Just when you think you should move on to another topic, she starts talking."
    "她的心情变得阴郁,沉默了好一会儿。当你以为应该换个话题时,她开始说话了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17647
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_b87323e6:

    # bast "Well... *sigh*"
    bast "那个啊...*叹气*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17649
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_d4ae83ca:

    # bast "I joined the order of builders as a teenager. I knew nothing about life, but I was good with my hands, so I was very enthusiastic about joining."
    bast "我十几岁的时候就加入了建筑师教团。我对生活一无所知,但擅长动手,所以对加入教团非常热衷。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17651
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_dc2ea5ca:

    # bast "The builders are like a tight-knit family... For me, a street orphan, it was a wonderful and new experience."
    bast "建筑师们就像一个亲密的大家庭...对我这个街头孤儿来说,这是一种全新的体验。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17653
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_f1d25529:

    # bast "I didn't have any experience with men either..."
    bast "我也没有任何男性方面的经验..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17655
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_673527cf:

    # "She stops for a while and looks up at the night sky."
    "她停下来,抬头看着夜空。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17657
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_cb675bff:

    # bast "I met a guy one market day, he was quite the talker. He was a trader of sorts, and he started complimenting me on my boobs."
    bast "有一天集市上,我遇到了一个建筑商,他说话真会说。他开始夸我的胸部。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17659
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_a654d281:

    # bast "At first I was shocked, but then I started enjoying the attention. I had gotten looks from some of the brothers, but someone approaching me so directly was a breath of fresh air."
    bast "起初我很震惊,但后来开始享受这种关注。我时常从兄弟们那里得到注视,但有人这么直接地接近我,让我感到清新。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17661
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_702e3212:

    # bast "I let him court me... I was aware he was good with words, and a womanizer, but I didn't really care... I liked how he made me feel."
    bast "我让他追求我...我知道他善于言辞,是个花花公子,但我并不在乎...我喜欢他让我感受到的东西。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17663
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_7396c361:

    # bast "So we started dating, and it was... wild. Intense. Physically speaking. Like, we were having sex everywhere, all the time..."
    bast "于是我们开始约会,那真是...疯狂。强烈。在身体方面。就是,到处做爱,不停歇..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17665
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_062b8e71:

    # you "Okay, okay. I get it."
    you "好了好了,我明白了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17667
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_e0b3cb93:

    # bast "Days went by, and he was asking me questions. Lots of questions, about my order, my brothers and sisters, the location of our buildings..."
    bast "日子一天天过去,他开始问很多问题。关于我的教团、兄弟姐妹,以及我们建筑物的位置等等。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17669
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_54c86b89:

    # bast "I was completely blind. I felt so close to him that I didn't even see what was wrong. I just told him whatever he wanted to know."
    bast "我完全被蒙蔽了。我感觉与他如此亲近,以至于看不到任何问题。我就告诉他想知道的一切。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17671
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_a0461045:

    # bast "One day, I woke up alone. I came in to work, to find our main warehouse had been raided during the night, just after the biggest caravan of the year had come into town."
    bast "有一天,我醒来时他已不见踪影。我来到工作岗位,发现我们的主仓库在前一晚最大的商队到达后被洗劫一空。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17673
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_91fa5d06:

    # bast "We lost tens of thousands of denars worth of merchandise... Worst of all, we quickly discovered my lover was the one who did it."
    bast "我们损失了价值数万法币的商品...最糟糕的是,我们很快发现,我的情人就是实施这起盗窃案的罪魁祸首。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17675
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_8e7f1887:

    # bast "He vanished with his booty, and I've never seen or heard from him since."
    bast "他带着战利品逃之夭夭,从此杳无音讯。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17677
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_ff334270:

    # bast "I confessed my mistakes to the order, and I was scolded harshly, rightly so."
    bast "我向教团坦白我的过错,受到了严厉的责骂,这是应该的。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17679
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_37f34cdb:

    # bast "But the brothers and sisters took pity on me, as I was heartbroken and hopeless... So they made me the Holy Builder as a punishment."
    bast "但兄弟姐妹们还是同情我,因为我伤心欲绝...所以他们把我任命为圣建筑师,这算是对我的惩罚。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17681
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_13719d64:

    # bast "I've been doing it for 5 years straight now. Thinking about it, this must be the first time I took half a day off."
    bast "我已经连续工作5年了。仔细想想,这大概是我第一次休息半天。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17683
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_07e34573:

    # you "You've been driving yourself way too hard..."
    you "你已经把自己逼得太紧了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17685
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_330d8ab1:

    # bast "It was a way to dull the pain..."
    bast "这是一种麻痹疼痛的方式..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17687
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_3158fb26:

    # bast "After all these years, you know what hurts the most?"
    bast "这么多年过去,你觉得最痛的是什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17689
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_122e22c9:

    # bast "It's not the lying, the betrayal, the thought that I have been used..."
    bast "不是谎言,不是背叛,不是被利用的想法..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17691
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_dd4627f9:

    # bast "But he didn't say goodbye. He didn't leave a note, or make up an excuse that he had to go. Not even a handkerchief left to remember him by..."
    bast "而是他没有说再见。他没有留下字条,也没有编造什么理由必须离开。连一条手帕都没留下让我记住他..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17693
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_1e25db50:

    # you "That's cruel..."
    you "这太残酷了..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17695
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_4ca17860:

    # bast "It's been five years, and I'm trying to convince myself that I am over him. But that part will always hurt."
    bast "已经5年了,我一直在说服自己已经走出来了。但那个部分永远都会痛。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17697
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17699
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_3594b446:

    # "Not knowing what to do, you simply move towards Bast and start hugging her."
    "不知道该怎么办,你只能向Bast走去,开始拥抱她。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17701
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_946bfdb3_1:

