    # "She tenses up at first, but she doesn't fight you. You can feel her large chest pressing against you and struggle to repress an erection."
    "起初她僵硬了,但没有挣扎。你能感受到她丰满的胸部压在你身上,努力压抑着勃起的欲望。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17705
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_0e34ff01:

    # "Ignoring your body's reaction, she relaxes gradually. After a while she breaks the embrace. You can see her cheeks are wet."
    "忽略你身体的反应,她渐渐放松下来。过了一会儿,她打断了拥抱。你看到她的脸颊湿润了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17707
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_754656e1:

    # bast "Oh, my, look at the time... I must go prepare the schedule for tomorrow's deliveries."
    bast "哦,天啊,看看时间...我得去准备明天交货的时间表了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17709
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_a167ff85:

    # bast "I had a nice time. Thank you."
    bast "我很开心。谢谢你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17711
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_5827dc4a:

    # you "I'm glad you did."
    you "我很高兴你这么说。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17713
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_5d5bfc7d:

    # bast "I'll see you around at the market."
    bast "我会在市场上再见到你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17715
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_4fa885f1:

    # you "Don't work yourself too hard, okay?"
    you "不要把自己逼得太紧,好吗?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17717
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_117e5a9d:

    # "For the first time since you've known her, she smiles."
    "从你认识她以来,这是她第一次笑。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17719
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_d36f73b2:

    # "She looks at you for a moment, as if thinking about something new."
    "她看着你,好像在思考些什么新的事物。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17721
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_946bfdb3_2:

    # bast "..."
    bast "..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17723
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_8fda6c43:

    # bast "You're an all right guy. Take care."
    bast "你是个不错的家伙。保重。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17725
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_48e5b785:

    # "She waves you a quick goodbye, turns around and leaves abruptly."
    "她快速挥手告别,转身便匆匆离开了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17730
translate chinese_simplified trade_50_resources_7811001a:

    # bast "Sorry, but I don't know you. I try to watch the company I keep."
    bast "抱歉,但我不认识你。我尽量谨慎交往。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:17732
