    thug3 "什么?"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:18910
translate chinese_simplified meet_ramias_267cda07:

    # ramias "The steel is pure, it looks well-balanced, and there's no hint of rust near the hilt. I like it."
    ramias "这钢铁很纯,看起来平衡性很好,刀柄附近也没有锈迹。我很喜欢。"

