    # "She is startled by your approach and looks at you for a moment before she recognizes you."
    "你的靠近吓到了她,她定睛看了你一会儿,才认出是你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19098
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_273b867e:

    # riche "You... I saw you before..."
    riche "你...我之前见过你..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19101
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_44c5595e:

    # riche "You were looking at me... *blush*"
    riche "你在看我....*脸红*"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19103
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_6cbce6f8:

    # you "Ah, yes... We haven't been properly introduced. My name is [MC.name]."
    you "啊,是的...我们还没正式介绍。我叫[MC.name]。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19105
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_04469f7e:

    # "She seems hesitant to reply. Her cheeks are red."
    "她犹豫着不想回答,脸颊通红。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19107
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_46cbd708:

    # riche "I, uh, I remember seeing you near the... the..."
    riche "我,呃,我记得在...在...附近看到过你。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19109
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_dc68f3c0:

    # you "Ah, yes. The brothel?"
    you "啊,是的。在青楼吗?"

