    # "Blood rushes to her cheeks. Her face is completely flushed."
    "血液冲上她的脸颊,整张脸都红透了。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19113
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_7088a794:

    # riche "I'm sorry... I..."
    riche "对不起...我..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19115
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_1d39cd0f:

    # you "It's just a business like anything else, nothing remarkable about it really. It's far from the only one of its kind in Zan..."
    you "那不过是一种普通的生意而已,没什么特别的。在泽恩还有很多家这样的青楼..."

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19117
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_0afa274f:

    # riche "You're... You're right I guess. I've just never met... a bro... brothel owner before."
    riche "你说得对,我只是从未见过...青楼老板。"

# game/BKstory_events.rpy:19119
translate chinese_simplified meet_riche_74a97030:

    # "Regaining her composure a little, she looks at you with a mix of apprehension and curiosity."
    "她稍稍恢复了一些镇定,带着一丝畏惧和好奇看着你。"

